## API Endpoints

Base URL: `http://localhost:{{PORT}}/api/v1`

{{#eq auth "none"}}{{else}}
### Auth — `/api/v1/auth`

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Rate Limit | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/auth/register` | Public | 5/min | Register new user |
| `POST` | `/auth/login` | Public | 10/min | Login, returns token(s) |
| `POST` | `/auth/forgot-password` | Public | 3/min | Send password reset email |
| `POST` | `/auth/reset-password` | Public | 5/min | Reset password via token |
| `GET` | `/auth/me` | 🔒 JWT | — | Get current user (guard demo) |
| `PATCH` | `/auth/change-password` | 🔒 JWT | — | Change password |
| `POST` | `/auth/upsert-user` | 🔒 JWT | — | Create or update user by email |
{{#eq auth "jwt-refresh"}}
| `POST` | `/auth/refresh` | 🔒 Refresh token | — | Rotate tokens |
{{/eq}}

#### Request / Response Examples

**POST `/auth/register`**
```json
// Request
{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "StrongP@ss1"
}

// Response 201
{
  "status": 201,
  "message": "Registration successful",
  "data": {
    "accessToken": "eyJhbGci..."{{#eq auth "jwt-refresh"}},
    "refreshToken": "eyJhbGci..."{{/eq}}
  }
}
```

**POST `/auth/login`**
```json
// Request
{ "email": "john@example.com", "password": "StrongP@ss1" }

// Response 200
{
  "status": 200,
  "message": "Login successful",
  "data": { "accessToken": "eyJhbGci..." }
}
```

**POST `/auth/forgot-password`**
```json
// Request
{ "email": "john@example.com" }

// Response 200 — always succeeds (prevents email enumeration)
{
  "status": 200,
  "message": "If that email exists, a reset link has been sent",
  "data": null
}
```

**POST `/auth/reset-password`**
```json
// Request
{ "token": "<token-from-email>", "newPassword": "NewStrongP@ss1" }

// Response 200
{ "status": 200, "message": "Password reset successfully", "data": null }
```

**PATCH `/auth/change-password`** *(requires Bearer token)*
```json
// Request
{ "currentPassword": "OldP@ss1", "newPassword": "NewStrongP@ss1" }

// Response 200
{ "status": 200, "message": "Password changed successfully", "data": null }
```
{{/eq}}

