## API Response Format

Every response — success or error — follows the same envelope:

```typescript
{
  status: number;   // HTTP status code
  message: string;  // Human-readable message
  data: T | null;   // Payload or null on error
}
```

**Success example**
```json
{ "status": 200, "message": "Profile fetched", "data": { "id": "...", "email": "..." } }
```

**Error example**
```json
{ "status": 401, "message": "Invalid credentials", "data": null }
```

**Validation error example**
```json
{ "status": 400, "message": "password must contain uppercase, lowercase, number and special character", "data": null }
```

