## Security

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| Helmet | Secure HTTP headers on every response |
| CORS | Allowlist via `CORS_ORIGINS` env var |
| Global rate limiting | `THROTTLE_LIMIT` req per `THROTTLE_TTL` ms per IP |
| Auth endpoint throttling | Register: 5/min · Login: 10/min · Forgot password: 3/min |
| Request ID | Every request gets a `x-request-id` header for tracing |
| Env validation | Joi schema — app crashes on startup if required vars are missing |
| Password policy | Min 8 chars, must include uppercase, lowercase, number, special char |
| Password hashing | bcrypt with configurable rounds (`BCRYPT_ROUNDS`, default 12) |
{{#or (eq auth "jwt") (eq auth "jwt-refresh")}}
| JWT expiry | Short-lived access tokens (default 15m) |
{{/or}}
{{#eq auth "jwt-refresh"}}
| Refresh rotation | New token pair issued on every refresh |
{{/eq}}
| Validation pipe | `whitelist: true` — strips unknown fields from all request bodies |

