## Code Quality & Git Hooks

### Husky hooks

| Hook | Runs | Checks |
|---|---|---|
| `pre-commit` | On every commit | ESLint + Prettier via lint-staged |
| `pre-push` | Before every push | Lint · No `console.log` · No commented-out code · No `.log` files |

### Lint-staged (on commit)

- ESLint auto-fix on all `*.ts` files
- Prettier format on all `*.ts` files
- Blocks commit if `console.log/warn/error` found
- Blocks commit if `.log` files are staged

### ESLint rules

- `@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any` — warn
- `@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars` — error (ignores `_` prefixed params)
- Prettier enforced as ESLint rule

